    a non-constant reversal-EVEN invariant exists (J, D9.1)                  = True
      of which:  J = 1 => r = 1, exceptions                                   = 0 of 8600
                 J = 0 on the defective squares                               = 1060 of 1060
    removable at   ['SEQ', 'REC']
    NOT removable at ['MULT', 'STATE', 'PORT', 'MENU']
