    group          = <2, 3> = the FULL group of 2-3-smooth positive rationals (free abelian of rank 2), at 10 scopes over three actor pools (2, 3, 4 actors) and two asymmetric sub-grammars = four mutually non-nested evidence pools
    seen / unseen  = 44 curvature-type + 44 descent-obstruction-type defective squares (the second half closes in MULT, a quotient graph on which the connection is not well defined — A3.5)

