  gates: 48 PASS / 0 FAIL   (of which 7 carry NO INDEPENDENT INFORMATION and are excluded from the evidence count: 41 independent passes)
    corollary: SRC.1 EXIT-FREEDOM GATED
    corollary: C0.1 r = mu(h.eA.eB)/mu(h.eB.eA) ON EVERY CLOSED SQUARE OF EVERY ARM.
    corollary: C0.2 THEREFORE THE NAIVE COBOUNDARY TEST IS VACUOUS AND MUST NOT BE REPORTED AS A RESULT.
    corollary: A3.3 THE HOLONOMY ON THE CARRIER IS NOT REMOVABLE, AND THIS IS THE NON-VACUOUS REMOVABILITY VERDICT C0 DEMANDED.
    corollary: D1 THE REVERSAL ACTS ON r BY INVERSION — A ONE-LINE LEMMA, NOT A MEASUREMENT.
    corollary: D3.1 ANY CONNECTION WHOSE VALUE DEPENDS ONLY ON THE EVENT LABEL HAS TRIVIAL HOLONOMY ON EVERY EXCHANGE SQUARE — a one-line theorem, gated by construction
    corollary: D4.1 THE i-TWIST 'RESTORES' DUAL CONJUGATION — AND THAT IS AN IDENTITY OF THE ANSATZ, NOT EVIDENCE.
  anchors: 0 failures (exit 1 threshold)
